OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain will move southeastwards
OL,6,Facross England and Wales and gradually
OL,7,Fclear from Shetland. Elsewhere there
OL,8,Fwill be sunshine and showers, the
OL,9,Fshowers heaviest in the northwest,
OL,10,Fwith some hail and thunder. Widely
OL,11,Fwindy, with temperatures dropping from
OL,12,Fthe northwest.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FThere will be clear spells
OL,15,Fand blustery showers overnight.
OL,16,FShowers will be most widespread in the
OL,17,Fnorth and west, and heaviest in the
OL,18,Fnorthwest, where hail and thunder is
OL,19,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
