OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FSaturday will bring sunny
OL,6,Fspells and showers, the showers
OL,7,Fheaviest in the northwest with some
OL,8,Fhail and thunder. A generally cool and
OL,9,Fblustery day, with coastal gales in
OL,10,Fthe northwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
